description "Viceroy Nute Gunray

A cowardly slimeball who'd prefer to observe the battle from far away.

^2Weaponry:
- Unskilled Melee
-- 100% slower RoF
-- Punch/block only
- DC-15S Clone Carbine (Yellow Saber)
-- No Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Staggers/trips/slows/disarms on hit
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
-- 10% slower movement
- EC-17 Hold-Out Blaster Pistol (DC Carb 1)
-- 200% slower RoF
-- 400% slower reload
- Security Resolution (Minigun 3)
-- Explodes/tracks/poisons/drains/slows on hit
-- Unblockable/hitscan charges
-- 99% less damage
-- 2800% slower RoF
-- 67% smaller splash

^5Powers:
- Protective Wealth (2) ^9{DB}
- Summon (3) ^3[CS2]

^6Inventory:
- Medpac
- Personal Energy Shield ^3[CS4]
- Shockfield ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- OOM Sec Droid (Bodyguard)
- Remote Viewer
- Dark's Beacon
- Healing (3)
- Recharge (2)
- Triggerbound
- Full Pockets
- 40% less knockback given
- 25% more knockback taken
- 100% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"